{"t":"PRCT","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"PROCEPT BioRobotics Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","employees":888,"hq":"San Jose, CA, United States","website":"https://www.procept-biorobotics.com","summary_en":"PROCEPT BioRobotics Corporation, a surgical robotics company, develops transformative solutions in urology in the United States and internationally. It develops, manufactures, and sells AquaBeam Robotic System, an image-guided, surgical robotic system for use in minimally invasive urologic surgery focusing on treating benign prostatic hyperplasia. The company also provides HYDROS Robotic System, which provides Aquablation therapy image-guided robotic therapy to treat males suffering from lower urinary tract symptoms due to benign prostatic hyperplasia. PROCEPT BioRobotics Corporation was incorporated in 2007 and is headquartered in San Jose, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"수술용 로봇 회사인 PROCEPT BioRobotics Corporation은 미국과 국제적으로 비뇨기과 분야의 혁신적인 솔루션을 개발합니다. 양성 전립선 비대증 치료에 초점을 맞춘 최소 침습 비뇨기과 수술에 사용되는 영상 유도 수술 로봇 시스템인 AquaBeam Robotic System을 개발, 제조 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 또한 양성 전립선 비대증으로 인해 하부 요로 증상을 겪는 남성을 치료하기 위해 Aquablation 치료 영상 유도 로봇 치료를 제공하는 HYDROS Robotic System을 제공합니다. PROCEPT BioRobotics Corporation은 2007년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아 주 산호세에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":24.52,"mcap":1410785664.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-19.706018,"peg":null,"ps":4.004444,"pb":4.282222,"ev_ebitda":-11.17,"div":0.0,"beta":0.838,"hi52":38.11,"lo52":16.665},"fin":{"rev":352304992.0,"rev_g":0.18,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.63748,"op":-0.34519002,"net":-0.32602,"roe":-0.32391998,"fcf":-44437376.0,"cash":218368992.0,"debt":76992000.0,"de":23.408,"eps":-2.01,"feps":-1.24429},"own":{"short":0.14050001,"inst":1.02231,"insider":0.03464},"analyst":{"n":12,"mean":22.75,"median":23.0,"high":30.0,"low":16.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.53333,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":3,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"b